Bundled journal, publisher and platform artwork

Retrieved 2026-11-16. The four PNG files preserve the complete source artwork,
its aspect ratio, and transparency. No letters, symbols or registration marks
are removed; no shape is redrawn or recomposed, and no white canvas is added.
Only fully transparent outer margins are trimmed. Network access is not needed
for these fallbacks. A publisher/platform fallback does not stop venue discovery
and is replaced when the server discovers an icon for that venue.

